# Land Cap makes white or blue and adds depletion; a counter prevents untapping, its upkeep trigger removes one, and with no counter it untaps normally.
[Bot1 Deck]
Land Cap
Island x19
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Land Cap.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Activate(Color: White)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Counters.Depletion = 1
! Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Activate(Color: Blue)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Counters.Depletion = 1
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Counters.Depletion = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Tapped = true
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Tapped = false
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Counters.Depletion = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Counters.Depletion = (absent)
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Land Cap.Counters.Depletion = (absent)
